    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "FY2025 10-K 对 Google Cloud 收入来源的披露是三类：Google Cloud Platform、Google Workspace、以及其他企业服务；其中 GCP 主要来自按使用量计费和订阅，Workspace 来自订阅。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000018",
            "index_id": "didx-320f0efaace7b324",
            "block_id": "block-000809-96c0700f",
            "quote": "“Google Cloud revenues consist of revenues from:”"
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000018",
            "index_id": "didx-320f0efaace7b324",
            "block_id": "block-000810-6ce30e96",
            "quote": "“Google Cloud Platform primarily generates consumption-based fees and subscriptions”"
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000018",
            "index_id": "didx-320f0efaace7b324",
            "block_id": "block-000811-43035749",
            "quote": "“Google Workspace includes subscriptions”"
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000018",
            "index_id": "didx-320f0efaace7b324",
            "block_id": "block-000812-9711d965",
            "quote": "“other enterprise services.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "2026 Q2 10-Q 在保留 GCP、Workspace 和其他企业服务的同时，新增/明确披露了“Product sales, primarily the sale of TPU systems.” 这一收入来源。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000071",
            "index_id": "didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5",
            "block_id": "block-000530-1e5177d1",
            "quote": "“Google Cloud revenues are comprised of the following:”"
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000071",
            "index_id": "didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5",
            "block_id": "block-000531-fa802653",
            "quote": "“Google Cloud Platform primarily generates consumption-based fees and subscriptions”"
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000071",
            "index_id": "didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5",
            "block_id": "block-000532-d23aecf2",
            "quote": "“Google Workspace includes subscriptions”"
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000071",
            "index_id": "didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5",
            "block_id": "block-000533-abd62671",
            "quote": "“Product sales, primarily the sale of TPU systems.”"
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000071",
            "index_id": "didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5",
            "block_id": "block-000534-d9e74cdc",
            "quote": "“Other enterprise services.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "10-Q 还补充说明：公司已签署向需要或提供本地基础设施的客户供应 TPU systems 的协议，并在 2026 年第二季度开始确认相关收入。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000071",
            "index_id": "didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5",
            "block_id": "block-000536-49e292da",
            "quote": "“In the second quarter of 2026, we began recognizing revenues from these agreements”"
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000071",
            "index_id": "didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5",
            "block_id": "block-000536-49e292da",
            "quote": "“the significant majority to be recognized in 2027.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "两期披露都表明云服务收入按 consumption 或 subscription 计；因此，不能仅据此把 2026 Q2 的 TPU systems 产品销售直接推断为传统云服务的新增计费模式。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000018",
            "index_id": "didx-320f0efaace7b324",
            "block_id": "block-000813-36abdfc1",
            "quote": "“cloud services are generally provided on either a consumption or subscription basis”"
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000018",
            "index_id": "didx-320f0efaace7b324",
            "block_id": "block-000813-36abdfc1",
            "quote": "“revenues related to cloud services provided on a consumption basis are recognized when the customer utilizes the services”"
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000018",
            "index_id": "didx-320f0efaace7b324",
            "block_id": "block-000813-36abdfc1",
            "quote": "“revenues related to cloud services provided on a subscription basis are recognized ratably over the contract term”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "不能据此推断：TPU systems 的协议覆盖范围很广、未来收入规模已可量化、或 2027 年前后收入贡献占比。披露仅说协议数量有限且大部分收入预计在 2027 年确认。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000071",
            "index_id": "didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5",
            "block_id": "block-000536-49e292da",
            "quote": "“We have signed a limited number of agreements”"
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000071",
            "index_id": "didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5",
            "block_id": "block-000536-49e292da",
            "quote": "“the significant majority to be recognized in 2027.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "也不能据此推断：TPU systems 收入是否已经成为 Google Cloud 的主要收入来源，或其对 Google Cloud 分部增长的具体贡献比例。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000071",
            "index_id": "didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5",
